<title>USA: Southland Corp Q3 shr decreases.</title>
<headline>Southland Corp Q3 shr decreases.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Thousands, Except Per-Share Data)</p>
<p>			     Three Months	     Nine Months</p>
<p>			 Ended September 30,    Ended September 30,</p>
<p>				1996	1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Total revenues   $1,860,048 $1,844,137 $5,251,904 $5,173,834</p>
<p> Net earnings	   37,686     49,647     73,562     85,443</p>
<p>Net earnings per</p>
<p>common share (primary</p>
<p>  and fully diluted)     .08	  .12	  .17	  .21</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>primary and fully</p>
<p>diluted shares (1)</p>
<p>			   482,035    409,923    482,134    409,923</p>
<p>Operating stores at</p>
<p>  end of period	  5,425	5,520	5,425	5,520</p>
<p>(1)  The 1996 weighted average number of primary and fully diluted shares includes the effect of the company's issuance of Convertible Quarterly Income Debt Securities in November 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
